{"Working-hours validation computes end from slotStartTime (ignoring event length) and rejects a slot if it's outside any working-hours segment, even if it's inside another segment on the same day, incorrectly removing valid slots and/or allowing slots that exceed the end boundary": 0.9489216804504395, "Date override logic attempts to compare Dayjs objects with === which is always false and makes that branch dead code": 0.899533748626709, "checkIfIsAvailable() returns true when it detects any date override on the slot's day, which bypasses the busy-time overlap logic and can mark conflicting slots as available, allowing double-booking on days with date overrides": 0.9436749815940857, "Date override check rejects a slot when it's outside any one override range on that day, which fails when multiple override ranges exist for the same day": 0.9236804246902466, "getSlots() computes timezone offsets via dayjs(override.start.toString()).tz(override.timeZone) but timeZone on TimeRange is optional and Date.toString() parsing is locale-dependent, which can produce incorrect offsets or fail when override.timeZone is undefined": 0.8945390582084656}